y, your name rhymes with Seytek’s;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l003","ordinal":375481,"en":"If we camp as one people and become friends,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l004","ordinal":375482,"en":"If angered, let us strike the foe,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l005","ordinal":375483,"en":"And dwell in Ala-Too, caring for the people."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l006","ordinal":375484,"en":"Let us make roads where there are none,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l007","ordinal":375485,"en":"And against the threatening enemy"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l008","ordinal":375486,"en":"Raise such turmoil as to halt them,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l009","ordinal":375487,"en":"Charging and striking them down."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l010","ordinal":375488,"en":"If we unite in one place,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l011","ordinal":375489,"en":"Can any eager enemy defeat us?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l012","ordinal":375490,"en":"Would an enemy approach our borders?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l013","ordinal":375491,"en":"Would warriors dare assail us,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l014","ordinal":375492,"en":"Or lay their cold hands upon us?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l015","ordinal":375493,"en":"This is what I say—understand it;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l016","ordinal":375494,"en":"Akjoltoy, heed my fierce words."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l017","ordinal":375495,"en":"Here is Ala-Too, your sustenance;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l018","ordinal":375496,"en":"Here am I, lion Seytek;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l019","ordinal":375497,"en":"If you are burdened, here is one to ease your sorrow;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l020","ordinal":375498,"en":"Here is your steed—the Kyrgyz people."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l021","ordinal":375499,"en":"Father, warrior Akjoltoy,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l022","ordinal":375500,"en":"Listen carefully to my words."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l023","ordinal":375501,"en":"Valiant hero of beks and khans,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l024","ordinal":375502,"en":"The place that has long troubled me—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l025","ordinal":375503,"en":"Where did you find, O leopard,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l026","ordinal":375504,"en":"The daughter of a peri who is my equal?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l027","ordinal":375505,"en":"That hapless peri-born maiden—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l028","ordinal":375506,"en":"Who is the man she has set her heart upon,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l029","ordinal":375507,"en":"And what land does she inhabit?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l030","ordinal":375508,"en":"Who are the people who will arrange"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l031","ordinal":375509,"en":"For me to reach her and become her husband?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l032","ordinal":375510,"en":"My valiant mother Aichürök"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l033","ordinal":375511,"en":"Once spoke these words distinctly."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l034","ordinal":375512,"en":"The bride I am destined to take"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l035","ordinal":375513,"en":"Would be the purest of peri maidens,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l036","ordinal":375514,"en":"The foremost among all women,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l037","ordinal":375515,"en":"Wearing a wondrous flowing gown—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l038","ordinal":375516,"en":"She described her thus."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l039","ordinal":375517,"en":"“She has a radiance like moonlight;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b002:l040","ordinal":375518,"en":"She is unlike all other mortals,” she said."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l001","ordinal":375519,"en":"If what she told me is true,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l002","ordinal":375520,"en":"If the maiden is indeed wondrous,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l003","ordinal":375521,"en":"If that serene poor soul"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l004","ordinal":375522,"en":"Truly possesses the nature of a peri,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l005","ordinal":375523,"en":"If she is a genuine peri maiden,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l006","ordinal":375524,"en":"If she firmly undertakes the task,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l007","ordinal":375525,"en":"Accepting whatever my appearance, good or bad,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l008","ordinal":375526,"en":"And never wounding my heart,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l009","ordinal":375527,"en":"If she makes my dwelling a guarded haven,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l010","ordinal":375528,"en":"And among all who hear and see,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l011","ordinal":375529,"en":"Spreads my fame among the people,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l012","ordinal":375530,"en":"And makes my settlement a thousand strong,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l013","ordinal":375531,"en":"If she does not oppose my word,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l014","ordinal":375532,"en":"Nor bring sorrow upon me,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l015","ordinal":375533,"en":"If she keeps my city flourishing"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l016","ordinal":375534,"en":"And continually spreads my renown”—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l017","ordinal":375535,"en":"When Seytek had spoken thus,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l018","ordinal":375536,"en":"Akjoltoy paused gravely, then spoke softly,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l019","ordinal":375537,"en":"And the warrior Akjoltoy began his speech,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l020","ordinal":375538,"en":"A man whose eyes discerned things from afar,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l021","ordinal":375539,"en":"A sage who had witnessed much:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l022","ordinal":375540,"en":"“Understand these blessed words;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l023","ordinal":375541,"en":"My precious fierce one, heed my speech."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l024","ordinal":375542,"en":"Whoever has seen the nature"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l025","ordinal":375543,"en":"Of that hapless peri-born maiden longs for her."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l026","ordinal":375544,"en":"Unless he were the son of a mighty hero,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l027","ordinal":375545,"en":"Who could ever win such a maiden?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l028","ordinal":375546,"en":"Eager to become your bride,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l029","ordinal":375547,"en":"Enamored of your face,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l030","ordinal":375548,"en":"And yearning for you yourself,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l031","ordinal":375549,"en":"Even for the traces of your passing,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l032","ordinal":375550,"en":"She donned armor woven of iron,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l033","ordinal":375551,"en":"Gathered a thousand peri warriors,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1049:b004:l034","ordinal":375552,"en":"And because of what had happened,"}]
